    "description": "Themes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets  is your first choice as a multifunctional and super practical app that can satisfy your custom home screen! lets you personalize and beautify your home screen with countless fancy and aesthetic wallpapers, icon packs, widgets. \r\n    \r\nThemes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets have countless advantages! As a free home screen app, Themes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets integrates an wallpaper changer, icon changer, widget pack and screen themer.From theme to icon to widget, exquisite integrated service is here! Multiple styles bring you a variety of aesthetic experiences! Find the beauty you love!\r\n\r\nAre these not enough? More reasons for you!\r\n\r\nWhy choose Themes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets?\r\n\ud83d\udd25Multiple aesthetic  themes!\r\n  \ud83e\uddd9Awesome designed wallpapers!\r\n  \ud83c\udf3aMany exquisite widgets!\r\n  \ud83d\udc93Exquisite icon packs!\r\n  \u2600\ufe0fSuper fast update speed!\r\n  \ud83d\ude0dPersonalization tailored for you!\r\n  \ud83c\udfc6Easy one-click replacement!\r\n\r\nNot familiar with how to use it? Step by step guide!\r\n  \r\n  Steps to Use Themes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets\r\n  1. Search for Themes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets and download it\r\n  2. Open Theme which you like\r\n  3. Choose the wallpapers,icon packs,widgets\r\n  4. Replace your choice with one click!\r\n\r\nAll themes, wallpaper,app icons, widgets of Themes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets are created by extraordinary designers! Each widget has a unique meaning, maybe a circle, maybe a rectangle, enough for you to customize!\r\n\r\nWhat should I do if there is a problem?\r\n\r\nContact us\r\nThemes-Wallpaper&Icons&Widgets to help and guide you! If there is any operation problem, you can send it to us. We will follow up and solve it in time.\r\nEmail address\uff1ainnovatoolpak@gmail.com",
